- Futex wait/wake evidence does not identify the awakened TID or prove causality. DQBUF counted 602 calls for 600 outputs without sequence fields, so exact dequeue-to-output identity remains unproven.
- AC-6 reconnect/sibling continuity and AC-8 four-camera soak remain hardware deferrals; the minor FFmpeg child resource-limit finding remains open.

